WEBVTT

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.846
AG: When your organization
lacks a sense of community

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:10.377
or you feel out of place
in the existing culture,

00:17:10.401 --> 00:17:12.966
you can build your own microcommunity.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:16.516
It's a group of people who understand you
and share your interests.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.386
That could be people
who go on runs before work,

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:23.146
or it might be a book club
or even a podcast club.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:26.055
That microcommunity
could connect outside of work

00:17:26.079 --> 00:17:27.876
or during work hours.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.086
And as Luz found, it doesn't
have to be a group of peers.